paragraph_text:
PNWGrc *nabuls ‘navel’ (ON nafli) > PWGmce *nabul6 (OF navila, OHG nabalo)
> *neebula > OE nafola;
PNWGmc *klawibo ‘itch’ (ON klddi) > PWGmc *klawibo (OHG klouwida with
shift of gender) > *klewipa > OE *klewipa > clewepa (see also 6.7.1 ad fin.);
PWGmce *natila ‘nettle’ (OS netila, OHG ne3z3ila) > *nzetil@ > OE netele (but see
below);

